# Subscriptions & live sessions

## Plans → entitlements

| Plan (wire) | Entitlements |
|-------------|--------------|
| STANDARD `0` | VIDEO `0` |
| PREMIUM `1` | VIDEO + LIVE |

- Gate VOD with `hasVideo` (free series may still play)
- Gate Live Join with `hasLive`; otherwise paywall PREMIUM — do not call join

## RevenueCat

- Purchases on device via `purchases_flutter`
- After login / purchase / restore → refresh `GET /mobile/user/entitlements`
- Do **not** call a purchase-complete API; webhook syncs the backend
- Package/product ids should contain `STANDARD` or `PREMIUM`

## Live join

- Browse: `GET /mobile/user/live-sessions` (no LIVE required)
- Join: `POST .../{slotId}/join?occurrenceStart=<exact startsAtRaw>`
- Response has `joinUrl` only → `url_launcher` external launch
- **Never** invent Zoom SDK / `meetingId` / passcode flows
- Join window UX: 30 min before start → 15 min after end
- Map `live_access_required`, `invalid_live_occurrence`, `invalid_live_week_slot_id`
